# Cursor Rules — FastAPI \+ Kafka

 ## 1\. Architecture

 Use a modular, layered architecture with clear separation between API, business logic, domain models, persistence, messaging, external services, infrastructure, and observability.

```
project/
├── app/
│   ├── main.py
│   │
│   ├── api/
